[en.DECISION_C18_DIE_NEBENWELT_UNSTABLE_TIMER]
The Rift

[en.DECISION_C18_DIE_NEBENWELT_UNSTABLE_TIMER_desc]
When the same individual from different worlds appears on the same world on a large scale, the entire world will collapse in instability.

[en.DECISION_C18_DIE_NEBENWELT_UNSTABLE_TIMER_TOOLTIP]
§RUnknown consequences...§!

[zh.DECISION_C18_DIE_NEBENWELT_UNSTABLE_TIMER]
裂隙

[zh.DECISION_C18_DIE_NEBENWELT_UNSTABLE_TIMER_desc]
来自不同世界的相同个体，大规模出现在同一个世界，那整个世界都会在不稳定中崩溃。

